# Domain applicability, design, and recheck card

Rule revision `sop-rules-addendum-20261016-0.1`. This is the English counterpart of the [original Chinese blank card](../规范补充-20261016/领域检查卡.md). Fill in actual project decisions and evidence. Give a brief scope reason for a domain with no trigger and retain unknowns as pending judgment. This card may be included in the product, technical, acceptance, or self-check sections of the main SOP. Keep the underlying business design in one place.

| DOM ID | Trigger facts and source location | Applicable, inapplicable, or pending judgment with reason | Original rules, objects, and revisions | Required depth and L1/L2/L3 | Document location or gap | Next action, owner, and blocker |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Screen DOM01–DOM08 | Unchecked | Pending judgment | Unbound | Pending | Unreviewed | Analyze |

