## Judgment and evidence

| Check ID and original condition | Object, source, and rule version | Required level | Actual result, method, and actor | Locatable evidence and supported scope | Counterexample or gap and impact | Closure or recheck conditions |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| CUSTOM:DOMxx | Unpinned | Pending | Unreviewed | No actual evidence | Analyze | Pending |

Record scope selection, applicability, evidence judgments, user declarations, document confirmation, task readiness, and runtime acceptance separately. Mark uncompiled checks as document review only, with no atomic machine receipt. Exclude duplicate checks from legacy scoring and application acceptance denominators.

